      "role": "user",
      "content": "Hey, I'm working on a backgrounder for a piece on the recent voting rights legislation that just passed. Can you give me a breakdown of the main points of contention? Specifically, I need to know what the proponents are saying and what the main concerns are from the opposition, and maybe touch on how valid those concerns actually are in the current legal landscape.",
